      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial microstructure contains local Mg-lean, Ti-rich compositional segregation near micropores.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12299034::web::017::3_1_microstructural_characterization_usi"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial microstructure contains numerous micropores.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12299034::web::017::3_1_microstructural_characterization_usi"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled elevated-temperature aging promotes diffusion-driven decomposition of the metastable solid solution toward an equilibrium or near-equilibrium state.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal aging forms fine, spatially distributed Ti- and Zn-rich intermetallic precipitates.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12299034::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti and Zn can form stable intermetallic compounds such as Ti2Zn and TiZn16 in Mg-based alloys.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12299034::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine intermetallic precipitates act as nucleation sites for protective oxide-scale formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting oxide scale is coherent and passivating and contains TiOx and/or MgO.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Appropriately distributed Ti- and Zn-containing intermetallic phases can impede corrosion-front progression.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12299034::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The size, morphology, and spatial distribution of intermetallic phases are important determinants of corrosion performance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12299034::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A protective oxide scale reduces further oxidation and localized corrosion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Improved oxide-scale integrity minimizes degradation associated with micropores.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After aging, the alloy will have a refined microstructure with more evenly distributed intermetallic compounds than the as-processed baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After aging, the alloy will have a more protective oxide scale than the as-processed baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "After aging, the alloy will exhibit a lower corrosion current density than the as-processed baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12299034::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
